SERIES LOGLINE

A young sea-rescue trainee discovers that the "skin disease" he's hidden since childhood is a living adaptive system—one that responds not just to his environment, but to his deepest desires. When a corporation comes to reclaim him as their property, he must decide whether to remain invisible or become something the world has never seen.

